<title>USA: TABLE - STAPLES INC SELLS $200 MLN IN DEBT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - STAPLES INC SELLS $200 MLN IN DEBT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Staples Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Staples is the second largest office superstore chain, headquartered in Westborough, Massachusetts.</p>
<p>BORROWER STAPLES INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 8/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.787  FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.155 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD +92 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>(( Caryn Trokie, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
